        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s26e",
          "text": "Liability can still fall on you after hitting an illegally parked car in Colorado, since fault depends on how the crash occurred and whether the collision could have been avoided. Colliding with a parked vehicle often raises an immediate question about fault, especially when the other car sits in a clearly illegal position.",
          "marks": []
