        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s26g",
          "text": "In Denver, responsibility does not automatically shift just because a vehicle violated parking rules, since insurers and courts closely examine how the crash occurred and whether a driver had the opportunity to avoid the impact. A driver who hits a car blocking a lane may still be held responsible depending on visibility, speed, and reaction time, and the consequences become more serious in a ",
